{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chenghuang-e-o092","title":"董袭凌统为前部董袭断绁助破黄祖","accounts":[{"id":"chenghuang-a-0ee3563a93a901e14de5","label":"正文","text":"董袭凌统为前部董袭断绁助破黄祖","evidence":["chenghuang-q-5561b24ab3f1f8f64c96"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0008","role":"与凌统俱为前部各将敢死百人人被两铠乘大舸船突入蒙冲里、身以刀断两绁","evidence":["chenghuang-q-5561b24ab3f1f8f64c96"]},{"person":"ling-tong","role":"俱为前部","evidence":["chenghuang-q-5561b24ab3f1f8f64c96"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0033","role":"横两蒙冲挟守沔口以栟闾大绁系石为碇上有千人以弩交射飞矢雨下军不得前、便开门走、兵追斩之","evidence":["chenghuang-q-5561b24ab3f1f8f64c96"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"讨黄祖、明日大会举觞属袭","evidence":["chenghuang-q-5561b24ab3f1f8f64c96"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-5561b24ab3f1f8f64c96"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-5561b24ab3f1f8f64c96","source_order":[55,178,0],"order":9858}],"persons":[{"id":"ling-tong","name":"凌统","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0008","name":"董袭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0033","name":"黄祖","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-5561b24ab3f1f8f64c96","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-471444036ab013326a61","layer":"original","quote":"建安十三年，权讨黄祖。祖横两蒙冲，挟守沔口；以栟闾大绁系石为碇〖7〗。上有千人，以弩交射，飞矢雨下，军不得前。袭与凌统俱为前部，各将敢死百人；人被两铠〖8〗，乘大舸船，突入蒙冲里〖9〗。袭身以刀断两绁，蒙冲乃横流。大兵遂进，祖便开门走，兵追斩之。明日大会，权举觞属袭曰〖10〗：“今日之会，断绁之功也","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":150}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
